║ • Behind: Birds (80 studs back)           ║
║ • Back-Left: Ice (diagonal)               ║
║                                            ║
║ Look for billboards & check top-right GUI ║
║ Cube spawns in FRONT - zones avoid it!    ║
╚════════════════════════════════════════════╝
]])